window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Imagine the man of your dreams. The blue eyes. The unruly blonde hair. The perfect abs. How strong his muscular thighs feel as you dig your fingernails into the denim of his jeans.</b></p> <p>Now imagine looking up to meet his gaze as he guides you towards his belt. Offers you a new life, a new destiny, a whole new world as he teaches you how to make him moan. Coaches you in the art of being sexy.</p> <p>Would you say no? Could you say no?</p> <p>Fletcher Novak is that perfect man and he just made Tiffy Preston the offer of a lifetime. And all she has to do is...everything he tells her.</p> <p><i>Sexy</i> is a full-length, standalone novel by <i>New York Times</i> best-selling author JA Huss.</p>"; 
